  "metadata": {
    "title": "Battery Datasets for Testing Data Pipelines and Workflow Automation",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.17295469",
    "publication_date": "2025-10-08",
    "description": "<p>This record contains battery datasets exported from different cyclers. It is intended to be used for testing and validating battery data pipelines and workflow automation. The datasets cover various battery chemistries and test types. Some contain common bugs that can occur during testing (e.g. bumping the connection cables) or from software export routines. Including data with bugs is done intentionally to verify data processing robustness.&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100.025%; height: 431.207px;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 43.5688%;\"><col style=\"width: 9.35642%;\"><col style=\"width: 9.82897%;\"><col style=\"width: 3.78037%;\"><col style=\"width: 6.33213%;\"><col style=\"width: 10.018%;\"><col style=\"width: 17.1062%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\"><strong>Filename</strong></td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\"><strong>File Type</strong></td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\"><strong>Cycler Manufacturer</strong></td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\"><strong>Cell Type</strong></td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\"><strong>Chemistry</strong></td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\"><strong>Test Type</strong></td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\"><strong>Bug Present</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 58.7642px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 58.7642px;\"><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/uploads/16994938\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SINTEF__NaCR32140-MP10-04__2025-08-25__CCCV_0p02C_25degC__BioLogic__Outlier_Bug.mpt</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 58.7642px;\">.mpt</td>\n<td style=\"height: 58.7642px;\">Bio-Logic</td>\n<td style=\"height: 58.7642px;\">Full Cell</td>\n<td style=\"height: 58.7642px;\">Na-ion</td>\n<td style=\"height: 58.7642px;\">CCCV Cycling at C/50</td>\n<td style=\"height: 58.7642px;\">Voltage and Current Outlier</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\"><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/uploads/16994938\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SINTEF__NaCR32140-MP10-04__2025-08-25__GITT_0p05C_25degC__BioLogic.mpt</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">.mpt</td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">Bio-Logic</td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">Full Cell</td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">Na-ion</td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">GITT</td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">None</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\"><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/uploads/16994938\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SINTEF__SLPBA842124HV__2024-10-23__Rate_25degC__Neware__Time_Bug.csv</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">.csv</td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">Neware</td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">Full Cell</td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">Li-ion</td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">Rate Capability</td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">Non-monotonic Total Time</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\"><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/records/17035637/draft/files/SINTEF__LiGrR2032__2024-04-30__25degC__Landt.csv/content\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SINTEF__LiGrR2032__2024-04-30__25degC__Landt.csv</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">.csv</td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">Landt</td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">Half-Cell</td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">Li-Graphite</td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">Cycling</td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">None</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\"><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/records/17035637/draft/files/SINTEF__LiGrR2032__2024-04-30__25degC__Landt.txt/content\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SINTEF__LiGrR2032__2024-04-30__25degC__Landt.txt</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">.txt</td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">Landt</td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">Half-Cell</td>\n<